<title>SWEDEN: Swedish consumer prices up 0.6 pct in Sept.</title>
<headline>Swedish consumer prices up 0.6 pct in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish consumer prices rose by 0.6 percent in September, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    SWEDISH CONSUMER PRICES    Sept 96    Aug 96    Sept 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.6     -0.4	 +0.7</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	    +0.2     +0.3	 +2.5</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980)	  256.0     254.5	256.2</p>
<p>Note - Economists polled by Reuters had expected consumer prices to rise by 0.9 percent in September.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
